  "body": " Thu Sep 10: What Is Integration?  Before we spent a whole chapter on integration, we wanted to know what you already think it means.   The question  Picture a made-up pond with a wiggly edge. There is no formula for its area. How would you figure out how much space it takes up?   This one is on paper: a guess first, then pick at least one video, app, article, or AI chat to explore, then a few sentences in your own words.   Open Preassignment-I (PDF) .  "
